181
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:32,140
你干嘛跟踪我
Why are you following me?

182
00:07:32,140 --> 00:07:33,520
你干嘛非跟我吵 妞儿
Why are you fighting me here, gorgeous?

183
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:35,420
咱俩之间有戏
This works.

184
00:07:36,540 --> 00:07:38,940
我真心 不喜欢
I really, really don't appreciate

185
00:07:38,940 --> 00:07:40,120
你叫我妞儿
you calling me "Gorgeous."

186
00:07:40,500 --> 00:07:42,280
我只想和家人享受美好时光
I just want to enjoy time with my family,

187
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:44,216
所以如果你不介意...
So if you don't mind--mm!

188
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:48,200
当然不介意 回见 阳光小美女
Not a problem. See you around, sunshine.

189
00:07:49,994 --> 00:07:52,020
你亲了个男孩
You kissed a boy!

190
00:07:52,020 --> 00:07:54,560
明明是他强吻我好不好 莉莉
No, the boy kissed me. Okay, Lily?

191
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:56,820
他吻我
The boy kissed me.

192
00:07:57,980 --> 00:08:00,720
*人生第一次 把那马儿骑*
*I rode a horse for the first time today*

193
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:05,100
*马儿嘶嘶叫 吓我心儿跳*
*wasn't surprised when it went... neigh*

194
00:08:05,100 --> 00:08:05,960
嘿 迪兰
Hey, Dylan.

195
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:08,091
你好呀 邓菲太太
Hey, Mrs. Dunphy.

196
00:08:08,100 --> 00:08:10,380
我们谈谈行吗
I was wondering if we could have a little chat.

197
00:08:11,367 --> 00:08:12,739
你想赶我走吧
Oh. You want me to go home.

198
00:08:12,739 --> 00:08:16,260
不是 与你想的正相反
No, no. It's the--the opposite of that.

199
00:08:16,260 --> 00:08:17,400
那就是"我想赶你走"
I want you to go home?

200
00:08:19,250 --> 00:08:24,320
不 我想让你知道 有你同行我很开心
No, I, um, I want you to know how glad I am that you're here.

201
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:24,740
真的吗
Really?

202
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:28,380
有时候我觉得你不喜欢我
'Cause sometimes I just get this vibe you don't like me.

203
00:08:28,380 --> 00:08:30,870
迪兰 不是的 真抱歉
Oh. Dylan, no. I'm sorry.

204
00:08:30,870 --> 00:08:32,377
我喜欢你
I-I like you.

205
00:08:32,387 --> 00:08:35,348
我好喜欢你 不过...
I-I like you a lot. I just...

206
00:08:35,620 --> 00:08:38,500
情况比较复杂 因为海莉是我女儿
it's complicated because Haley's my daughter.

207
00:08:38,820 --> 00:08:40,920
我靠 我靠 不是吧
Whoa. Whoa, whoa.

208
00:08:41,560 --> 00:08:45,240
你虽然是个辣妈 但我不能违背伦常
You are totally a hot mom, but I can't do this.

209
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:48,329
我的天 乱了 不是这么回...不
Oh, my god. Okay, we--there's--no, no.

210
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:53,120
我只想说 要是怠慢你了 我道歉
I merely meant that I'm sorry if I made you feel unwelcome.

211
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:55,640
呼... 不然可就尴尬了
Whew! That would have been awkward.

212
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:56,780
超尴尬
So awkward.

213
00:08:56,780 --> 00:08:58,917
但说句老实话 邓菲太太
You know, but for the record, Mrs. Dunphy...

214
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:00,300
什么
Yes?

215
00:09:00,700 --> 00:09:02,320
如果海莉不是我女朋友
If Haley wasn't my girlfriend...

216
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:04,526
而且没有邓菲先生插足的话
and mr. Dunphy was out of the picture...

217
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:07,300
我愿与你同床共枕
I would be honored to share your bed

218
00:09:07,300 --> 00:09:09,700
把卢克 艾丽克斯和海莉当做亲生孩子一样养大
And raise Luke, Alex, and Haley as my own.

219
00:09:11,680 --> 00:09:12,200
好吧
Okay.

220
00:09:13,460 --> 00:09:14,200
聊得很开心
Good talk.

221
00:09:18,300 --> 00:09:20,260
*夕阳沉沉落山间*
*She'll be running down the mountain*

222
00:09:20,260 --> 00:09:28,340
*夕阳沉沉落山间 明天悄悄再升起*
*She'll be running down the mountain when she comes*

223
00:09:28,340 --> 00:09:30,840
歌两分钟前就该结束了
The song ended two minutes ago.

224
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:33,640
我跟你说 她都能演《艾薇塔》了
Well, I'll tell you what, she could play Evita.

225
00:09:33,640 --> 00:09:36,693
是吗 你没发现连蟋蟀都走干净了
Really? You notice the crickets left?

226
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:38,520
还有人想喝水吗
Anyone want more water?

227
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:39,660
老爸 我要一瓶
Oh, Dad, I'll take one.

228
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,100
接住了
Heads up.

229
00:09:41,189 --> 00:09:42,963
我的天啊
Oh! Oh, my gosh.

230
00:09:43,665 --> 00:09:46,320
天太黑了 我没看见 谢了
Oh. It was--it was dark. I-I couldn't see it. Thank you.

231
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:48,000
你那个爆竹放了吗
So did you set off the firecracker yet?

232
00:09:48,420 --> 00:09:50,680
如果我真放了 一定天下大乱
When I do, you won't have to ask.

233
00:09:50,726 --> 00:09:53,257
首先 所有的电子产品都会失灵
First, all the electronics will go out,

234
00:09:53,257 --> 00:09:55,994
接着热浪进袭
Then comes the heat flash.

235
00:09:56,040 --> 00:09:58,400
之后 所有人都会生不如死
Afterwards, the living will envy the dead.

236
00:09:58,501 --> 00:10:00,990
你如此残暴 上禁飞名单的竟然是我
And yet I'm the one on the no-fly list.

237
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:04,060
这样吧 下次由我来接
You know what? Maybe next time I'll just catch it,

238
00:10:04,060 --> 00:10:04,960
然后把它递给你
and then hand it to you.

239
00:10:05,060 --> 00:10:06,820
好吧 行 就那么做
Oh, okay. Yeah, let's do that.

240
00:10:06,820 --> 00:10:08,840
你全部包办 我无所事事
You--you do everything, and I'll do nothing.

241
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:09,780
你有心事吗
Something on your mind?

242
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:12,440
众人面前 不方便谈这事
This isn't the right place to talk about it.

243
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:13,200
好吧
Okay.

244
00:10:14,014 --> 00:10:15,980
我...我...
I-I'm s--

245
00:10:16,180 --> 00:10:17,720
我在想到底该不该再要一个孩子
I'm not sure if we should have another baby.

246
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:20,060
什么 你说真的吗
What? Are you serious?

247
00:10:20,260 --> 00:10:21,900
或许咱们有点操之过急
I think that we might be rushing into this.

248
00:10:22,140 --> 00:10:23,360
操之过急 咱们已经努力
Rushing into-- we've been working--

249
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:27,240
各位 我是迪兰
Everybody, it's me, Dylan.

250
00:10:28,380 --> 00:10:31,600
我只想谢谢大家能带我一起来旅行
I just wanted to thank you all for bringing me on this trip,

251
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:33,520
让我觉得如你们的家人一般
and making me feel like one of the family,

252
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:35,600
特别谢过红太狼
especially bossy.

253
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:39,660
我想趁此绝好时机
So I can't think of a better time

254
00:10:39,660 --> 00:10:42,760
问问我心爱的女人
to ask something of the woman that I love.

255
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:44,560
好吧
Okay.

256
00:10:46,820 --> 00:10:49,060
不 不
No, no.

257
00:10:49,823 --> 00:10:51,980
海莉·格温多林·邓菲
Haley Gwendolyn Dunphy,

258
00:10:51,980 --> 00:10:53,620
你愿意赐我殊荣
will you do me the honors

259
00:10:53,620 --> 00:10:54,680
做我合法的妻...
of being my lawfully wedded--

260
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:57,000
停下 不行 不能求婚
No. No, no, no, no, no. No proposals.

261
00:10:57,140 --> 00:10:58,260
现在不行 门都没有
Not now. Not gonna happen.

262
00:10:58,340 --> 00:10:59,220
她还是个孩子 所以...
She's a child, so...

263
00:10:59,220 --> 00:11:01,140
-妈 -你才是个高中生啊
- Mom! - You're still in high school!

264
00:11:01,140 --> 00:11:02,380
可以等她毕业再结婚
I meant after she graduates.

265
00:11:02,380 --> 00:11:03,560
现在不行 那时也不行
Not then. Not now.

266
00:11:03,620 --> 00:11:04,160
永远都不行
Not ever.

267
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:06,260
说真的 你们俩要靠什么生活
Seriously, what are you two gonna live off of?

268
00:11:06,260 --> 00:11:08,640
靠你那烂歌赚的版税
The--the--the royalties from the horsey song?

269
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:10,780
-把那玩意放回去 -你还有完没完
- Put it back in your pocket. - Would you stop it?

270
00:11:10,780 --> 00:11:12,200
没完 绝对没完
No, I won't. I won't.

271
00:11:12,300 --> 00:11:13,140
没事 没关系
No, it's okay.

272
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:15,380
我还是先回屋了
I guess I'll just turn in.

273
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:17,560
预先告诉你们一声 我小屋的风扇不好
Just so you know, there's a fan in my cabin

274
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:18,960
声音如泣似诉
that sounds like someone crying.

275
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:21,580
迪兰 等等 我恨你
Dylan, wait! I hate you!

276
00:11:21,780 --> 00:11:24,140
算了吧 海莉 回这儿来
Oh, come on. Haley, get back here!

277
00:11:24,460 --> 00:11:25,580
菲尔 能说句话吗
Phil, anything?

278
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:27,100
你说得就够多了 克莱尔
I think you said it all, Claire.

279
00:11:27,180 --> 00:11:28,080
你想让我把她捆起来吗
You want me to rope her?

280
00:11:28,620 --> 00:11:29,720
我可以的
I can, you know.

281
00:11:31,060 --> 00:11:32,020
听不听由你们
For what it's worth,

282
00:11:32,060 --> 00:11:34,060
当年我第二个老婆就是高中生
my second wife was in high school.

283
00:11:39,628 --> 00:11:41,066
甜心 这儿 看着
Sweetie, here. Here we go.

284
00:11:41,066 --> 00:11:44,111
-一 二 三 -一 二 三
- One, two, three. - One, two, three.

285
00:11:44,298 --> 00:11:47,560
-没啦 -它不见啦 它在那儿呢
- Gone. - It's gone! It's over there!

286
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:49,020
它不在那儿
It's not back there.

287
00:11:49,020 --> 00:11:51,184
-我们是数到三的 -对
- We counted to three. - Yes.

288
00:11:52,040 --> 00:11:52,560
你去哪儿了
Where have you been?

289
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:54,740
我昨晚在门房睡沙发
I-I slept on the couch in the lodge.

290
00:11:54,740 --> 00:11:56,440
我知道你昨晚不想跟我大吵
I know you didn't want to have a big fight last night.

291
00:11:56,500 --> 00:11:57,320
现在我准备好了
Well, I'm ready now.

292
00:11:58,220 --> 00:11:59,080
小卡 对不起
Cam, I'm sorry.

293
00:11:59,508 --> 00:12:02,420
要是我没法做那些父子活动怎么办
Look, what if I can't do the father-son stuff?

294
00:12:02,420 --> 00:12:03,980
打猎啊 运动啊
The hunting, the--the sports,

295
00:12:03,980 --> 00:12:04,820
看《活宝三人组》啊
the Three Stooges?

296
00:12:04,920 --> 00:12:06,140
你知道现实生活是什么
You know what happens in real life

297
00:12:06,140 --> 00:12:07,520
要是有人脑袋让梯子砸了
when someone gets hit in the head with a ladder,

298
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:10,131
他们会去医院做核磁共振
they go to the hospital and they get an M.R.I.

299
00:12:10,380 --> 00:12:11,400
那片子里可没这么演
Never see that scene.

300
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:13,080
我觉得你想得太多了
I think you're overthinking this.

301
00:12:13,540 --> 00:12:15,860
我爱运动 我爱看《活宝三人组》
You know, I love sports, I love the stooges.

302
00:12:15,880 --> 00:12:16,980
我们能搞定的
We've got this covered.

303
00:12:16,980 --> 00:12:19,040
不 不是的 你能搞定
No. No, you--you got it covered,

304
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:21,340
但是我只能坐冷板凳
but I'm just stuck on the sidelines,

305
00:12:21,780 --> 00:12:23,420
假装懂得那些规则 而且...
pretending to understand the rules, and...

306
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:26,180
我爸一贯狂野粗暴
You know, my dad was a rough-and-tumble guy.

307
00:12:26,180 --> 00:12:27,700
我...我向来和他难以兴趣相投
And I just-- I could never relate to him.

308
00:12:28,380 --> 00:12:30,260
我不知道 我觉得我无法承受
And I don't know. I just don't think I could handle

309
00:12:30,260 --> 00:12:32,780
和父亲 儿子的关系都很失败
disappointing... two generations.

310
00:12:33,700 --> 00:12:35,220
我觉得你比你自己想象的
I think you're more masculine

311
00:12:35,220 --> 00:12:36,900
要爷们儿得多
Than you give yourself credit for.

312
00:12:39,140 --> 00:12:41,260
谁把鸟巢建在走廊旁边的
Who puts a birdhouse next to a porch?

313
00:12:43,535 --> 00:12:44,656
克莱尔 我知道你害怕
Claire, I know that you're worried

314
00:12:44,667 --> 00:12:46,546
迪兰会玩弄海莉的感情
that Dylan is gonna break Haley's heart,

315
00:12:46,546 --> 00:12:48,020
但我从他眼中读出了
but I see in his eyes

316
00:12:48,020 --> 00:12:49,760
白头到老的执着
that he's gonna stick with her forever.

317
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:52,720
无论怎样 他都会跟她在一起
No matter what, he's always going to be with her.

318
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,820
等到你临终前
On your deathbed--

319
00:12:53,820 --> 00:12:56,200
好了 行了 我受不了了
Okay. All right. I can't take this anymore.

320
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:56,920
我得去找她
I'm gonna go find her.

321
00:12:57,260 --> 00:13:00,080
不行 逼得太紧只会适得其反
No. You push too hard, you chase her right into his arms.

322
00:13:00,100 --> 00:13:01,820
到时候那个蠢蛋就真成你女婿了
You'll end up with a boob for a son-in-law.

323
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,180
相信我 你绝对不想变成那样
Believe me, you don't want that.

324
00:13:03,260 --> 00:13:04,500
你这话是什么意思
What's that supposed to mean?

325
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:06,460
-怎么了 -你们有人看见迪兰了吗
- What? - Hey, have you guys seen Dylan?

326
00:13:06,700 --> 00:13:07,860
没 没有 怎么了
No. No. Why?

327
00:13:07,860 --> 00:13:08,800
我不想理你
I'm not talking to you.

328
00:13:08,860 --> 00:13:10,440
他昨晚说过要出去走走
He said he was going out for a walk last night,

329
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,600
此后他就一直不见踪影
and no one's seen him since.

330
00:13:12,260 --> 00:13:13,720
亲爱的 我敢保证他没事
Sweetheart, I'm sure he's fine.

331
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:15,640
可能他昨晚直接回家了
Maybe after last night, he just went home.

332
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:17,540
不太可能 他行李还在这呢
Doubt it. He left his luggage.

333
00:13:17,540 --> 00:13:18,600
我们得想想办法
We have to do something.

334
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:20,980
一天不吃上五顿饭 他就会"飘然若仙"
If he doesn't eat five times a day, he gets spacey.

335
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:22,460
真想看看那是什么样子
What would that even look like?

336
00:13:22,620 --> 00:13:24,680
我们会找到他的 汉克
We'll find him. Hank?

337
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:26,620
我们这儿出了点状况
We got a situation here!

338
00:13:26,700 --> 00:13:28,160
什么状况
What seems to be the trouble?

339
00:13:32,060 --> 00:13:33,140
我们得谈谈
We need to talk.

340
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:34,260
谈什么
What?

341
00:13:34,860 --> 00:13:36,720
你偷走了我的初吻
You stole my first kiss.

342
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:38,220
有没有搞错
What are you talkin' about?

343
00:13:38,220 --> 00:13:39,520
我早幻想过了
I had it all planned out.

344
00:13:39,800 --> 00:13:41,120
我的初吻经历要很特别
It was supposed to be special,

345
00:13:41,540 --> 00:13:43,340
他必须成绩倍儿棒 前途无量
someone with a high GPA And a bright future,

346
00:13:43,340 --> 00:13:44,880
而不是"马里奥兄弟"
not a Mario Brother.

347
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:48,040
好吧 听着 我压根不稀罕你的吻
Fine. You know what? I don't even want your kiss.

348
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:49,442
拿去 还给你
Here, you can have it back.

349
00:13:50,649 --> 00:13:51,801
好了 咱俩扯平了
There. Now we're even.

350
00:13:51,801 --> 00:13:54,188
你自个儿留着吧 我不想要了
Well, keep it. I don't -- I don't want it anymore.

351
00:13:57,280 --> 00:13:58,960
我在干什么啊
What am I doing?

352
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:00,600
好了 大伙儿听着
Okay, people.

353
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:03,060
看来我们之中有人走失了
Looks like we have a walker.

354
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:05,720
此刻他面对的是险恶的地形
Right now he is facing treacherous terrain,

355
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:08,060
以及暗洞 山狮和饿熊
sudden drops, mountain lions,

356
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:10,880
对了 还有狼獾呢
hungry bears, oh, and wolverines.

357
00:14:10,880 --> 00:14:13,640
前提是他还没被冻死
That is, if the hypothermia didn't already get him.

358
00:14:13,700 --> 00:14:14,980
为什么又故地重游了
Why did we come here again?

359
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:17,780
我们最好兵分三路
So our best bet is to split up.

360
00:14:17,780 --> 00:14:20,120
你俩负责搜索北面步道
You two are gonna take the North hiking trail.

361
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:22,000
-我能和我爸一队吗 -不行
- Can I go with my dad instead? - Negative.

362
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:24,600
水牛菲尔和老前辈
I need buffalo phil and old-timer

363
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:26,180
得沿着斯内克河前进
to check the Snake River.

364
00:14:26,380 --> 00:14:27,280
水牛菲尔
Buffalo Phil --

365
00:14:28,180 --> 00:14:29,020
最后的才是最好的绰号啊
worth the wait.

366
00:14:29,380 --> 00:14:32,380
我和仙人球负责天命山脊
Me and cactus flower will ride on up to Destiny Ridge.

367
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:34,140
应该让我陪她才对吧
Maybe I should ride up there with her.

368
00:14:34,500 --> 00:14:38,020
没门儿 那条路线只适合高阶骑手
Negatory. That trail is for advanced riders only.

369
00:14:38,020 --> 00:14:39,640
我可不想再出人命
We don't need another dead body.

370
00:14:39,640 --> 00:14:40,220
"再出人命"
"Another"?

371
00:14:40,220 --> 00:14:42,378
上马 出发
Let's go! Move 'em out.

372
00:14:44,579 --> 00:14:47,785
菲尔 帮我挂上马鞍 行吗
Phil, help me saddle my horse, will ya?

373
00:14:47,785 --> 00:14:50,467
瞧瞧岳父大人在向谁求助
Well, look who's suddenly needed by his father-in-law.

374
00:14:50,467 --> 00:14:51,824
菲儿啊
Phyllis.

375
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:52,560
菲尔
Phil --

376
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:53,040
是也
is.

377
00:14:55,899 --> 00:14:57,980
米奇舅舅 你在做什么
Hey, uncle Mitch. Whatcha doing?

378
00:14:57,980 --> 00:14:58,620
你好
Oh, hey.

379
00:14:58,620 --> 00:15:00,736
想些心事罢了
Just -- just thinkin'.

380
00:15:01,580 --> 00:15:03,820
听着 我一直想告诉你
You know, I've been meaning to tell you,

381
00:15:03,940 --> 00:15:05,300
你是个超有趣的舅舅
you're a super fun uncle.

382
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:06,960
这可是小男生的肺腑之言
And I'm saying this as a boy.

383
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:09,140
是卡梅隆舅夫派你来的吧
Uncle Cameron sent you over here, didn't he?

384
00:15:09,600 --> 00:15:11,080
什么 别搞笑了
What? That's hilarious.

385
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:13,380
我就爱你跟我这样开玩笑
No, I love how you and me can joke like this.

386
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:16,540
卢克 听着 我不知道小卡向你透露了多少
Okay, Luke, look, i don't know how much Cam told you,

387
00:15:16,540 --> 00:15:17,800
但我觉得 这种问题
but I don't think this is a problem

388
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:19,601
你帮不了的 这事...
that you can help me with. It's...

389
00:15:19,820 --> 00:15:22,200
好吧 我承认 是我自己遇到了问题
Okay, good. I've got my own problem.

390
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:23,657
什么 怎么了
What? What's that?

391
00:15:24,180 --> 00:15:25,280
你能替我保密吗
Can you keep a secret?

392
00:15:25,680 --> 00:15:27,700
说吧 我将一个大秘密守了22年[同志身份]
I kept a pretty big one for 22 years, so...

393
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:30,460
我有个没用过的爆竹
I've got this new firecracker,

394
00:15:30,460 --> 00:15:32,000
不知道该拿它来炸什么
and I can't decide what to blow up.

395
00:15:32,140 --> 00:15:33,400
卢克 这玩意很危险
Oh, Luke, that's dangerous.

396
00:15:33,620 --> 00:15:35,660
我知道 玩的就是心跳嘛
I know. That's what's fun about it.

397
00:15:35,660 --> 00:15:36,920
我真搞不懂男孩子们
I don't get boys.

398
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:39,360
搞破坏有什么好的
What is so great about destroying things?

399
00:15:39,540 --> 00:15:42,740
碎片四溅的多过瘾啊
It turns stuff into flying chunks of stuff.

400
00:15:42,740 --> 00:15:45,595
好吧 不 交给我 快点
Okay, no. No, g-give it to me. Come on.

401
00:15:45,900 --> 00:15:46,420
好吧
fine.

402
00:15:46,756 --> 00:15:49,579
算我看错你了 你没那么有趣
I take it back. You're not that fun.

403
00:15:54,500 --> 00:15:56,820
好吧 不如这样
All right, hey, look, um,

404
00:15:56,820 --> 00:15:57,980
我们一起点了它 好吗
we'll do it together, all right?

405
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:02,260
你刚做了你这辈子最正确的决定
You just made the best decision of your life.

406
00:16:07,580 --> 00:16:08,300
该死
Damn it!

407
00:16:08,640 --> 00:16:10,360
金凤花 这马出了什么毛病
Buttercup! What the hell's wrong with this horse?

408
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:14,440
杰
Jay.

409
00:16:16,520 --> 00:16:17,520
我想和你谈谈
I want to talk to you about

410
00:16:17,520 --> 00:16:18,740
你早餐时说的关于女婿的言论
that son-in-law crack you made at breakfast.

411
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:21,460
-我没什么特别的意思 -我觉得你有
- Oh, I didn't mean anything by that. - I think you did.

412
00:16:22,220 --> 00:16:24,260
我知道我不是你最中意的女婿人选
I get that I wasn't your first choice to marry Claire,

413
00:16:24,300 --> 00:16:26,300
但结婚十八年来 我没有哪一天
but it's been 18 years, and there hasn't been a day

414
00:16:26,300 --> 00:16:27,940
对克莱尔不是一心一意
when I wasn't a loyal husband to your daughter

415
00:16:27,940 --> 00:16:29,440
对你的孙子孙女不是疼爱有加
and a great dad to your grandkids.

416
00:16:29,540 --> 00:16:31,640
要是你还不满意 那就是你的问题
So if we've still got a problem, now it's your problem.

417
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:41,300
菲尔 等会儿
Phil, wait up.

418
00:16:42,395 --> 00:16:44,062
我问你一个问题 男人之间的对话
Let me ask you something, man to man.

419
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:45,880
问吧
Okay.

420
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:48,500
你有没有注意到...
You notice anything funny about the --

421
00:16:49,122 --> 00:16:50,132
汉克那家伙和...
Hank character and, uh...

422
00:16:50,140 --> 00:16:50,420
歌洛莉亚吗
Gloria?

423
00:16:50,640 --> 00:16:51,900
当然了 他在勾引她 怎么了
Yeah, he's hitting on her. Why?

424
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:53,000
我就知道
I knew it.

425
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:54,320
你要去哪儿
Where are you going?

426
00:16:54,500 --> 00:16:55,320
天命山脊
Destiny ridge.

427
00:16:56,880 --> 00:16:57,760
金凤花 驾
Buttercup, ha!

428
00:16:58,957 --> 00:17:00,726
金凤花 驾驾
Buttercup, hiya!

429
00:17:01,220 --> 00:17:01,780
有没有搞错
Seriously?

430
00:17:04,860 --> 00:17:06,060
没问题 鸟屋是空的
Okay. Okay, it's clear.

431
00:17:06,542 --> 00:17:09,760
炸了它 就能看到真实版愤怒的小鸟了
After this, we're gonna have some angry birds.

432
00:17:09,760 --> 00:17:10,140
没错
Yeah.

433
00:17:10,140 --> 00:17:12,467
我们就该喊"拜拜小鸟"
It's gonna be "Bye Bye Birdie."

434
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:15,560
那是六十年代的一台大型音乐剧
It's a big musical from the '60s.

435
00:17:15,780 --> 00:17:17,260
算了 还是叫愤怒的小鸟吧
No. Forget it. What you said.

436
00:17:17,780 --> 00:17:18,320
可以了
Okay.

437
00:17:19,651 --> 00:17:20,931
好 撤
Okay, go.

438
00:17:26,380 --> 00:17:27,480
就这样吗
That's it?

439
00:17:27,540 --> 00:17:28,640
很遗憾 老弟
I'm sorry, buddy.

440
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:30,963
亏我大老远买过来...
I brought that thing all the way from...

441
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:39,800
小卡 我终于做了件男人的事 我把鸟窝炸了
Cam, I did a boy thing! I blew up the birdhouse!

442
00:17:40,020 --> 00:17:42,000
你真该看看 酷毙了
You should have seen it. It was so awesome.

443
00:17:42,060 --> 00:17:42,760
太棒了
That's great!

444
00:17:43,100 --> 00:17:44,760
是的 我觉得我能行
Yeah. I think I can do this.

445
00:17:45,020 --> 00:17:46,940
我是说 或许还要一步步一件件来
I mean, maybe not everything and maybe not right away,

446
00:17:46,940 --> 00:17:49,150
-暂时无法忍受《活宝三人组》 -那就不看
- and not the Three Stooges... - No.

447
00:17:50,180 --> 00:17:51,340
我确定了 我想要一个儿子
I do. I want a son.

448
00:17:52,080 --> 00:17:53,200
对不起 之前有点恐慌
I'm sorry I panicked.

449
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,300
那好极了
Oh, that's great.

450
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:56,880
我们继续拍照攒相册吧
Now maybe we can go back to taking pictures for the book.

451
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:58,720
好啊 拍张我炸飞鸟窝的照片
Yes! Pictures of me blowing up stuff!

452
00:17:58,980 --> 00:18:00,880
好吧 我觉得咱矫枉过正了
Okay, I see we've overcorrected.

453
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:03,960
我知道你认定我是个毒妈
I know you think I'm the mean mom

454
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:05,680
棒打鸳鸯 不准你们结婚
who wouldn't let you marry your boyfriend,

455
00:18:05,700 --> 00:18:06,920
但是总有一天你会明白
but someday you're gonna realize,

456
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:08,920
我这么做是为你好
I did what had to be done.

457
00:18:09,140 --> 00:18:12,060
不 别狡辩 我从来就没有打算跟迪兰结婚
No, you didn't. I was never gonna marry Dylan.

458
00:18:12,140 --> 00:18:13,040
我拒绝了他
I told him no.

459
00:18:13,360 --> 00:18:14,820
真的吗 谢天谢地
Oh, you did? Thank god.

460
00:18:14,860 --> 00:18:16,960
他是向我求婚 要由我来拒绝
But it was my proposal to turn down.

461
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:19,620
你一直让我像个大人
You know, you keep telling me to act like an adult,

462
00:18:19,620 --> 00:18:21,120
但你从来不给我这个机会
but then you don't even give me a chance.

463
00:18:21,120 --> 00:18:24,500
你真说到点子上了
Oh. You sort of got me there.

464
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:27,120
但是 亲爱的 我不指望你知父母心
But, sweetheart, I don't expect you to understand this.

465
00:18:27,120 --> 00:18:29,000
在你这个年纪的时候 我也不懂
I certainly didn't when I was your age.

466
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:32,200
在我心目中 你只是个孩子 永远都是
I look at you as my baby, and I always will.

467
00:18:32,460 --> 00:18:33,640
当妈的都这样
It's just what moms do.

468
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:35,860
我不是小孩子了
I'm not a baby anymore!

469
00:18:36,360 --> 00:18:39,360
明白吗 我再也见不到迪兰了
Okay? And I am never gonna see Dylan again!

470
00:18:40,080 --> 00:18:40,340
迪兰
Dylan!

471
00:18:41,320 --> 00:18:41,960
迪兰
Dylan!

472
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:43,000
什么事
What?!

473
00:18:43,740 --> 00:18:45,120
你在哪
Where are you?!

474
00:18:45,820 --> 00:18:46,500
怀俄明州
Wyoming!

475
00:18:47,640 --> 00:18:48,820
你没事
You're okay!

476
00:18:49,140 --> 00:18:50,980
我度过了有生以来最疯狂的夜晚
I had the craziest night.

477
00:18:51,360 --> 00:18:54,680
你拒绝我后 我觉得很迷茫 很害怕
When you rejected me, I felt lost and scared.

478
00:18:55,240 --> 00:18:57,100
后来我就出去走走
And then I went out on a walk,

479
00:18:57,100 --> 00:18:59,820
走着走着我真迷路了 才真害怕了
and I felt a whole different kind of lost and scared.

480
00:18:59,820 --> 00:19:01,600
后来我在马厩睡着了
And then I fell asleep in the stable.

481
00:19:01,600 --> 00:19:04,700
醒来时 我碰见了一位叫杰克的女人
And when I woke up, I met this woman named Jake

482
00:19:04,700 --> 00:19:06,567
她壮得像个爷们似的
who's strong like a man.

483
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:09,720
我们谈了很久 他或者她 雇佣了我
Then we had this long talk, and he/she hired me.

484
00:19:10,040 --> 00:19:12,480
什么叫她雇佣你了
Uh, what do you mean, she hired you?

485
00:19:12,540 --> 00:19:13,640
我现在在这工作了
I work here now.

486
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:15,120
你要留下来吗
So you're staying?

487
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:17,480
-是啊 -那我们怎么办
- Yeah. - What about us?

488
00:19:17,600 --> 00:19:20,540
我们走不到一起的 你我门不当户不对
It could never work. We're from two different worlds.

489
00:19:20,780 --> 00:19:22,540
你是高中生
You're a high school student,

490
00:19:22,540 --> 00:19:24,000
而我是农场工人
and I'm a ranch hand.

491
00:19:25,420 --> 00:19:28,400
你没事 你没事我很开心 真的
I'm just--I'm so glad you're okay. I really am.

492
00:19:28,420 --> 00:19:31,340
谢谢 但我们是不能和客人太亲密的
Thanks. But we're not supposed to fraternize with the guests.

493
00:19:31,340 --> 00:19:32,873
好吧
Okay.

494
00:19:36,060 --> 00:19:36,620
迪兰
Dylan!

495
00:19:40,280 --> 00:19:40,840
迪兰
Dylan!

496
00:19:40,914 --> 00:19:46,300
你的声音好响亮 像草地鹨似的
You got a voice like a meadowlark, don't ya?

497
00:19:46,300 --> 00:19:46,860
迪兰
Dylan!

498
00:19:46,860 --> 00:19:51,520
我真为那孩子担心
Yeah, I sure am worried about that kid.

499
00:19:51,520 --> 00:19:52,080
迪兰
Dylan!

500
00:19:53,280 --> 00:19:54,640
他又不在我屁股底下
He ain't down there.

501
00:19:54,860 --> 00:19:58,800
拜托 你来这是为了体验牛仔生活
Oh, come on now. You come up here for the cowboy experience.

502
00:19:59,700 --> 00:20:00,800
你面前这位就是牛仔
You're looking at him.

503
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:04,320
我看起来像是水性杨花的女人吗
Do I look like the kind of woman that would cheat on her husband?

504
00:20:04,320 --> 00:20:04,800
是的
Yes.

505
00:20:05,740 --> 00:20:06,200
真的吗
Really?

506
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:10,060
你小子 最好离我女人远点
Hey! I think you better move away from that woman.

507
00:20:10,960 --> 00:20:13,280
我们的女人要拒绝 也只有我们能霸王硬上弓
Only we touch our women when they don't want us to.

508
00:20:13,280 --> 00:20:15,240
别紧张 朋友
Easy. Easy there, friend.

509
00:20:15,240 --> 00:20:16,660
我没有勾引这个女人
I wasn't hitting on this filly.

510
00:20:17,300 --> 00:20:18,880
这是旅游项目的一部分
This is all part of the package.

511
00:20:19,580 --> 00:20:21,300
如果我不扮恶棍
If I didn't play the bad guy,

512
00:20:21,300 --> 00:20:23,660
他也就没机会骑马赶过来 英雄救美了
he wouldn't get to ride up and be the big hero.

513
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:25,660
不需要你来衬托他的英雄形象
He doesn't need you to make him a hero.

514
00:20:25,840 --> 00:20:27,120
他天天都是英雄
He's a hero every day.

515
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:29,480
你识趣一点吧 骑上马
Why don't you do us all a favor? Get back on your horse,

516
00:20:29,492 --> 00:20:31,820
回到旅馆 告诉他们
ride down to the lodge and tell 'em--

517
00:20:31,820 --> 00:20:32,440
你能让他别动吗
Can you keep him still?

518
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:33,160
-我在说话呢 -我尽力了
- I'm trying to make a point. - I am.

519
00:20:34,060 --> 00:20:35,700
好的 我就走
Okay. Okay, I'm gone.

520
00:20:35,770 --> 00:20:37,068
女士
Ma'am.

521
00:20:37,840 --> 00:20:40,240
等等
Wait. Wait.

522
00:20:40,394 --> 00:20:42,370
你给我听好了
There's something I wanna say to you.

523
00:20:42,500 --> 00:20:44,580
你们的客户点评卡上
I will only be checking "somewhat satisfied"

524
00:20:44,580 --> 00:20:46,120
-我只填基本满意 -老天啊
- on our comment card. - Jeez.

525
00:20:47,400 --> 00:20:48,680
他对孩子们很好呀
I mean, he was great with the kids.

526
00:20:53,060 --> 00:20:54,360
我查过了
I looked it up.

527
00:20:54,360 --> 00:20:58,200
我们房子之间的距离是2443英里
The distance between our houses is 2,443 miles.

528
00:20:58,200 --> 00:21:00,047
但是有些地图上
Yeah, but, you know, on some maps,

529
00:21:00,047 --> 00:21:01,740
只有这么短
it's like--pfft! this big.

530
00:21:01,740 --> 00:21:02,920
天呐 你真笨
God, you're stupid.

531
00:21:06,300 --> 00:21:08,060
总而言之 这个假期棒极了
All in all, it was a great vacation.

532
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:11,360
或许我们失去了一个人
We may have lost a man...

533
00:21:14,800 --> 00:21:17,700
但在茫茫山野 苍苍天穹之中
But out there on the range, under that great big sky,

534
00:21:17,780 --> 00:21:20,160
我们发现了 自己未曾发现过的真我
we found a part of ourselves we never knew was there,

535
00:21:20,980 --> 00:21:23,340
真被那个色鬼牛仔说中了
just like the horny cowboy said we would.

536
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:25,240
别这样
No.

537
00:21:25,940 --> 00:21:26,500
好吧
Fine.
